        <p data-pasted="true">Posted September 8, 2026 | Updated September 25, 2026</p><p data-pasted="true"><b data-pasted="true" role="emphasis"><span style="font-size: 20px;">2026 General Election Constitutional Amendments</span></b></p><p><span style="font-size: 18px;">The Lee County Supervisor of Elections gives notice that on Tuesday, November 3, 2026, three (3) State Constitutional Amendments will appear on the ballot, and the voters of the County will be asked whether they approve or disapprove of amending the Florida Constitution.</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 18px;"><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/1131" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 Constitutional Amendments (English PDF)</a></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-size: 18px;" data-pasted="true"><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/1132" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 Constitutional Amendments (Spanish PDF)</a></span></span></p>
