        <p><span style="font-size: 14px;">Posted September 8, 2026</span></p><p data-pasted="true"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><strong><span style="font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">2026 Town of Fort Myers Beach Town Charter Amendment Referendums</span></strong></span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;" data-pasted="true">The Lee County Supervisor of Elections gives notice that on Tuesday, November 3, 2026,&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">the Town of Fort Myers Beach will place six (6) referendums on the ballot at which&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;">voters of the</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">&nbsp;Town&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;">will be asked if they approve or disapprove&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">amending the Town Charter</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;">.</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">&nbsp;For more information, Town voters may&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">contact the Town Clerk at 239-765-0202, Extension 1400, or&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;" data-pasted="true"><a href="https://www.fortmyersbeachfl.gov/m/directory/employee?eid=42" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.fortmyersbeachfl.gov/m/directory/employee?eid%3D42&source=gmail&ust=1788611517355000&usg=AOvVaw25XTO8lbnWc8-xmbUi5Nbg" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">email the Clerk</a></span><span style="font-size: 18px;">.</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 18px;"><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/1086" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Ballot Language (English PDF)</a></span><br><span style="font-size: 18px;"><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/1087" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Ballot Language (Spanish PDF)</a><br><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/1088" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Ordinance 26-08 (English / Spanish PDF)</a></span></p>
