        <p aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-pasted="true"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">Posted: September 15, 2026 | Updated: September 23, 2026</span></p><p data-pasted="true"><span style="font-size: 18px;">The following candidates withdrew their names from the November 3, 2026, General Election:</span></p><p style="margin-left: 20px;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Town of Fort Myers Beach Town Council</span></strong></span></p><ul style="margin-left: 20px ;" role="presentation"><li style="font-size: 18px;">John McLean - withdrew 9/15/2026</li></ul><p data-pasted="true" style="margin-left: 20px;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong><span style="font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Gateway Services Community Development District - Seat 4</span></strong></span></p><ul style="margin-left: 20px ;" role="presentation"><li style="font-size: 18px;" data-pasted="true">Paul LeoGrande - withdrew 9/23/2026</li></ul><p style="margin-left: 40px;"><strong><em><span style="color: rgb(192, 0, 0);">Important Note: Due to the late withdrawal, the candidate&apos;s name will still appear on the ballot. Any votes for balloted, withdrawn candidates will be tallied, but will not count.&nbsp;</span></em></strong><span style="color: rgb(192, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: italic; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;" data-pasted="true"><strong>A vote cast in the Gateway Services Community Development District Seat 4 race will not change the outcome, as the remaining candidate is deemed by law to be unopposed and elected for that race. All votes cast in this race will be tallied but will not count.</strong></span></p><p><br></p>
    </div>

